//! Cities: first economy experiment. Amounts use quarter units; routes use half-hex costs.
//!
//! This module holds the city types, the tuning constants and the city scenarios' setup; each
//! submodule adds an `impl GameState` block for one concern: `builds` (the build queues,
//! completing builds), `economy` (the stockpile, paying for queued items), `supply` (the
//! military supply limit), `barracks` (deposits and training caps), `citizens` (the priority
//! order, the managers and their workers, the economy tick), `logistics` (delivery routes and
//! income), `rail` (Railhead transfers), `founding` (settlers) and `view` (the city and Barracks
//! views, ending planning).

